@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
actor User
participant "UI Layer\n(NewMessageDialog)" as UI
participant "Logic Layer\n(MessageService)" as Logic
database "Database\n(MongoDB)" as DB

User -> UI : 1. Select Recipient, Text & Attach File
activate UI
UI -> Logic : 2. Create Message Request
activate Logic
Logic -> DB : 3. Save Attached File (FilesRepository)
activate DB
DB --> Logic : 4. Return unique FileID
deactivate DB
Logic -> DB : 5. Save Message Object with FileID (MessageRepository)
activate DB
DB --> Logic : 6. Confirm Save
deactivate DB
Logic --> UI : 7. Return Success
deactivate Logic
UI --> User : 8. Display Success Notification & Refresh Grid
deactivate UI
@enduml